  "raw_text": "$$\\int_{0}^{1} \\sqrt{x} f(x) \\mathrm{d}x \\approx A_{0} f(x_{0}) + A_{1} f(x_{1}),$$\n(4.4.7)\n\n令它对于 $f(x) = 1, x, x^{2}, x^{3}$ 准确成立，得\n\n$$\\begin{cases} A_{0} + A_{1} = \\frac{2}{3}, \\\\ x_{0} A_{0} + x_{1} A_{1} = \\frac{2}{5}, \\\\ x_{0}^{2} A_{0} + x_{1}^{2} A_{1} = \\frac{2}{7}, \\\\ x_{0}^{3} A_{0} + x_{1}^{3} A_{1} = \\frac{2}{9}. \\end{cases}$$\n(4.4.8)\n\n由于 $x_{0} A_{0} + x_{1} A_{1} = x_{0} \\left(A_{0} + A_{1}\\right) + \\left(x_{1} - x_{0}\\right) A_{1}$,\n\n利用式(4.4.8)的第一式，可将第二式化为\n\n$$\\frac{2}{3} x_{0} + \\left(x_{1} - x_{0}\\right) A_{1} = \\frac{2}{5}.$$\n\n同样地，利用第二式化第三式，利用第三式化第四式，分别得\n\n$$\\frac{2}{5} x_{0} + \\left(x_{1} - x_{0}\\right) x_{1} A_{1} = \\frac{2}{7}, \\quad \\frac{2}{7} x_{0} + \\left(x_{1} - x_{0}\\right) x_{1}^{2} A_{1} = \\frac{2}{9}.$$\n\n从上面三个式子中消去 $(x_{1} - x_{0}) A_{1}$，有\n\n$$\\begin{cases} \\frac{2}{5} x_{0} + \\left(\\frac{2}{5} - \\frac{2}{3} x_{0}\\right) x_{1} = \\frac{2}{7}, \\\\ \\frac{2}{7} x_{0} + \\left(\\frac{2}{7} - \\frac{2}{5} x_{0}\\right) x_{1}^{2} = \\frac{2}{9}, \\end{cases}$$\n\n即\n\n$$\\begin{cases} \\frac{2}{5} \\left(x_{0} + x_{1}\\right) - \\frac{2}{3} x_{0} x_{1} = \\frac{2}{7}, \\\\ \\frac{2}{7} \\left(x_{0} + x_{1}\\right) - \\frac{2}{5} x_{0} x_{1} = \\frac{2}{9}. \\end{cases}$$\n\n由此解出\n\n$$x_{0} x_{1} = \\frac{5}{21}, \\quad x_{0} + x_{1} = \\frac{10}{9},$$\n\n从而求出\n\n$$x_{0} = 0.821162, \\quad x_{1} = 0.289949,$$\n\n$$A_{0} = 0.389111, \\quad A_{1} = 0.277556.$$\n\n于是形如式(4.4.7)的 Gauss 公式是\n\n$$\\int_{0}^{1} \\sqrt{x} f(x) \\mathrm{d}x \\approx 0.389111 f\\left(0.821162\\right) + 0.277556 f\\left(0.289949\\right).$$"
